<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Synthetic Document</title>
    <style>
        @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
        .page {
            width: 794px; height: 1123px;
            padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
            overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
            position: relative;
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
        }
        .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
        h1, h2, h3 {
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial;
        }
        p, td {
            font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, "Helvetica";
        }
        .header-logo {
            float: left;
            margin-right: 40px;
        }
        .header-title {
            font-size: 36pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            line-height: 1.1;
        }
        .section-title {
            font-size: 18pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-top: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .course-detail-item {
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }
        .course-detail-item strong {
            display: inline-block;
            width: 100px;
        }
        .image-container {
            float: right;
            margin-left: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .image-container img {
            max-width: 100%;
            height: auto;
        }
        .footer-contact {
            margin-top: 40px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #ccc;
        }
        .contact-info p {
            margin: 5px 0;
        }
        .logo-small {
            float: right;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page">
        <div class="header-logo">
            <!-- Placeholder for UTEP Logo -->
        </div>
        <div style="clear: both;"></div>
        <div class="header-title">
            THE UNIVERSITY OF TEXAS AT EL PASO
        </div>
        <div style="clear: both;"></div>
        <h1 style="font-size: 48pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 10px;">
            Additive Manufacturing Training and Workforce Development Programs
        </h1>
        <div style="clear: both;"></div>

        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-top: 40px;">
            <div style="flex: 2;">
                <p>Our training sessions are designed for military, government, educational institutions, and private businesses. They provide a significant focus on the use of additive manufacturing (AM, also known as 3D printing) and its applications. Only state-of-the-art equipment and software are utilized. The content is well-balanced, consisting of hands-on exercises and lectures.</p>

                <div style="display: flex; gap: 50px; margin-top: 30px;">
                    <div style="flex: 1;">
                        <div class="section-title">AM LECTURE</div>
                        <div class="course-detail-item"><strong>Duration:</strong> <span data-field="am_lecture.duration">{{ am_lecture.duration }}</span></div>
                        <div class="course-detail-item"><strong>Class size:</strong> <span data-field="am_lecture.class_size">{{ am_lecture.class_size }}</span></div>
                        <div class="course-detail-item"><strong>Location:</strong> <span data-field="am_lecture.location">{{ am_lecture.location }}</span></div>
                        <div class="course-detail-item"><strong>Trainer:</strong> <span data-field="am_lecture.trainer">{{ am_lecture.trainer }}</span></div>
                        <div class="course-detail-item"><strong>Printers:</strong> <span data-field="am_lecture.printers">{{ am_lecture.printers }}</span></div>
                        <div class="course-detail-item"><strong>Style:</strong> <span data-field="am_lecture.style">{{ am_lecture.style }}</span></div>
                        <div class="course-detail-item"><strong>Topics:</strong>
                            <ul>
                                <li><span data-field="am_lecture.topics[0]">{{ am_lecture.topics[0] }}</span></li>
                                <li><span data-field="am_lecture.topics[1]">{{ am_lecture.topics[1] }}</span></li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div style="flex: 1;">
                        <div class="section-title">INTRODUCTION TO DESKTOP 3D PRINTING</div>
                        <div class="course-detail-item"><strong>Duration:</strong> <span data-field="intro_desktop_3d_printing.duration">{{ intro_desktop_3d_printing.duration }}</span></div>
                        <div class="course-detail-item"><strong>Class size:</strong> <span data-field="intro_desktop_3d_printing.class_size">{{ intro_desktop_3d_printing.class_size }}</span></div>
                        <div class="course-detail-item"><strong>Location:</strong> <span data-field="intro_desktop_3d_printing.location">{{ intro_desktop_3d_printing.location }}</span></div>
                        <div class="course-detail-item"><strong>Trainers:</strong> <span data-field="intro_desktop_3d_printing.trainers">{{ intro_desktop_3d_printing.trainers }}</span></div>
                        <div class="course-detail-item"><strong>Printers:</strong> <span data-field="intro_desktop_3d_printing.printers">{{ intro_desktop_3d_printing.printers }}</span></div>
                        <div class="course-detail-item"><strong>Style:</strong> <span data-field="intro_desktop_3d_printing.style">{{ intro_desktop_3d_printing.style }}</span></div>
                        <div class="course-detail-item"><strong>Topics:</strong>
                            <ul>
                                <li><span data-field="intro_desktop_3d_printing.topics[0]">{{ intro_desktop_3d_printing.topics[0] }}</span></li>
                                <li><span data-field="intro_desktop_3d_printing.topics[1]">{{ intro_desktop_3d_printing.topics[1] }}</span></li>
                                <li><span data-field="intro_desktop_3d_printing.topics[2]">{{ intro_desktop_3d_printing.topics[2] }}</span></li>
                                <li><span data-field="intro_desktop_3d_printing.topics[3]">{{ intro_desktop_3d_printing.topics[3] }}</span></li>
                                <li><span data-field="intro_desktop_3d_printing.topics[4]">{{ intro_desktop_3d_printing.topics[4] }}</span></li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="image-container">
                <img src="placeholder_image_1.jpg" alt="Training session image 1">
                <div style="clear: both;"></div>
                <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 20px;">LEVEL I TRAINING: INTRO TO ADDITIVE MANUFACTURING (AM)</div>
                <div class="course-detail-item"><strong>Duration:</strong> <span data-field="level_i.duration">{{ level_i.duration }}</span></div>
                <div class="course-detail-item"><strong>Class size:</strong> <span data-field="level_i.class_size">{{ level_i.class_size }}</span></div>
                <div class="course-detail-item"><strong>Location:</strong> <span data-field="level_i.location">{{ level_i.location }}</span></div>
                <div class="course-detail-item"><strong>Trainers:</strong> <span data-field="level_i.trainers">{{ level_i.trainers }}</span></div>
                <div class="course-detail-item"><strong>Printers:</strong> <span data-field="level_i.printers">{{ level_i.printers }}</span></div>
                <div class="course-detail-item"><strong>Style:</strong> <span data-field="level_i.style">{{ level_i.style }}</span></div>
                <div class="course-detail-item"><strong>Topics:</strong>
                    <ul>
                        <li><span data-field="level_i.topics[0]">{{ level_i.topics[0] }}</span></li>
                        <li><span data-field="level_i.topics[1]">{{ level_i.topics[1] }}</span></li>
                        <li><span data-field="level_i.topics[2]">{{ level_i.topics[2] }}</span></li>
                        <li><span data-field="level_i.topics[3]">{{ level_i.topics[3] }}</span></li>
                        <li><span data-field="level_i.topics[4]">{{ level_i.topics[4] }}</span></li>
                        <li><span data-field="level_i.topics[5]">{{ level_i.topics[5] }}</span></li>
                        <li><span data-field="level_i.topics[6]">{{ level_i.topics[6] }}</span></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="page">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 30px;">
            <div style="flex: 1;">
                <div class="section-title">LEVEL II TRAINING: ADVANCED ADDITIVE MANUFACTURING (AM)</div>
                <div class="course-detail-item"><strong>Duration:</strong> <span data-field="level_ii.duration">{{ level_ii.duration }}</span></div>
                <div class="course-detail-item"><strong>Class size:</strong> <span data-field="level_ii.class_size">{{ level_ii.class_size }}</span></div>
                <div class="course-detail-item"><strong>Location:</strong> <span data-field="level_ii.location">{{ level_ii.location }}</span></div>
                <div class="course-detail-item"><strong>Trainers:</strong> <span data-field="level_ii.trainers">{{ level_ii.trainers }}</span></div>
                <div class="course-detail-item"><strong>Printers:</strong> <span data-field="level_ii.printers">{{ level_ii.printers }}</span></div>
                <div class="course-detail-item"><strong>Style:</strong> <span data-field="level_ii.style">{{ level_ii.style }}</span></div>
                <div class="course-detail-item"><strong>Topics:</strong>
                    <ul>
                        <li><span data-field="level_ii.topics[0]">{{ level_ii.topics[0] }}</span></li>
                        <li><span data-field="level_ii.topics[1]">{{ level_ii.topics[1] }}</span></li>
                        <li><span data-field="level_ii.topics[2]">{{ level_ii.topics[2] }}</span></li>
                        <li><span data-field="level_ii.topics[3]">{{ level_ii.topics[3] }}</span></li>
                        <li><span data-field="level_ii.topics[4]">{{ level_ii.topics[4] }}</span></li>
                        <li><span data-field="level_ii.topics[5]">{{ level_ii.topics[5] }}</span></li>
                        <li><span data-field="level_ii.topics[6]">{{ level_ii.topics[6] }}</span></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div style="flex: 1; margin-left: 40px;">
                <div class="section-title">LEVEL III TRAINING: CUSTOMIZED TECHNOLOGY-SPECIFIC OPERATIONS</div>
                <div class="course-detail-item"><strong>Duration:</strong> <span data-field="level_iii.duration">{{ level_iii.duration }}</span></div>
                <div class="course-detail-item"><strong>Class size:</strong> <span data-field="level_iii.class_size">{{ level_iii.class_size }}</span></div>
                <div class="course-detail-item"><strong>Location:</strong> <span data-field="level_iii.location">{{ level_iii.location }}</span></div>
                <div class="course-detail-item"><strong>Trainers:</strong> <span data-field="level_iii.trainers">{{ level_iii.trainers }}</span></div>
                <div class="course-detail-item"><strong>Machines:</strong> <span data-field="level_iii.machines">{{ level_iii.machines }}</span></div>
                <div class="course-detail-item"><strong>Style:</strong> <span data-field="level_iii.style">{{ level_iii.style }}</span></div>
                <div class="course-detail-item"><strong>Topics:</strong>
                    <ul>
                        <li><span data-field="level_iii.topics[0]">{{ level_iii.topics[0] }}</span></li>
                        <li><span data-field="level_iii.topics[1]">{{ level_iii.topics[1] }}</span></li>
                        <li><span data-field="level_iii.topics[2]">{{ level_iii.topics[2] }}</span></li>
                        <li><span data-field="level_iii.topics[3]">{{ level_iii.topics[3] }}</span></li>
                        <li><span data-field="level_iii.topics[4]">{{ level_iii.topics[4] }}</span></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="footer-contact">
            <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 0;">FOR MORE INFORMATION, PLEASE CONTACT:</div>
            <div class="contact-info">
                <p><strong>Name:</strong> <span data-field="contact.full_name">{{ contact.full_name }}</span></p>
                <p><strong>Title:</strong> <span data-field="contact.title">{{ contact.title }}</span></p>
                <p><strong>Phone:</strong> <span data-field="contact.phone">{{ contact.phone }}</span></p>
                <p><strong>Email:</strong> <span data-field="contact.email">{{ contact.email }}</span></p>
                <p><strong>Address:</strong> <span data-field="contact.address">{{ contact.address }}</span></p>
            </div>
            <div style="clear: both;"></div>
            <div class="logo-small">
                <!-- Placeholder for W.M. Keck Center Logo -->
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>